  "solution": "Given, equation \n\n17 * 4 * 6 * 2 * 4 = 9\n\nChecking every options:\n\n \n• 17 **×** 4 **÷** 6 **+** 2 **-** 4 = 9\n\n \n L.H.S = 17 × __4 ____÷ 6__ + 2 - 4\n\n \n L.H.S = __**17 × 0.66**__ + 2 - 4\n\n \n L.H.S = __**11.33 + 2**__ - 4\n\n \n L.H.S = **__13.33 - 4__**\n\n \n L.H.S = 9.33 ; R.H.S = 9\n\n \nL.H.S ≠ R.H.S\n\n \n \n• 17 **-** 4 **+** 6 **÷** 2 **×** 4 = 9\n \n L.H.S = 17 - 4 + __**6 ÷ 2**__ × 4\n\n \n L.H.S = 17 - 4 + __**3 × 4**__\n\n \n L.H.S = __**17 - 4**__ +12\n\n \n L.H.S = __**13 + 12**__\n\n \n L.H.S = 25 ; R.H.S = 9\n\n \n L.H.S ≠ R.H.S \n\n \n \n• 17 **+** 4 **-** 6 **÷** 2 **×** 4 = 9\n \n L.H.S = 17 + 4 - __**6 ÷ 2**__ × 4\n\n \n L.H.S = 17 + 4 - __**3 × 4**__\n\n \n L.H.S = __**17 + 4**__ -12\n\n \n L.H.S = __**21 - 12**__\n\n \n L.H.S = 9 ; R.H.S = 9\n\n ** L.H.S = R.H.S**\n \n \n• 17 **-** 4 **×** 6 **+** 2 **÷** 4 = 9\n\n L.H.S = 17 - 4 × 6 + __**2 ÷ 4**__\n\n L.H.S = 17 - __**4 × 6**__ + 0.5\n\n L.H.S = __**17 - 24**__ + 0.5\n\n L.H.S = __**7 + 0.5**__\n\n **L.H.S = 7.5 ; R.H.S = 9**\n\n** L.H.S **≠ R.H.S\n\nHence, the correct answer is ' **+ - ÷ ×** .'",
